        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The skeleton is a 3rd-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Intelligence (spell save DC 12, +4 to hit with spell attacks). It requires no vocal component to cast its spells. The skeleton has the following mage spells prepared:\nCantrips (at will): blade ward, mage hand, ray of frost\n1st level (4 slots): ice knife, mage armor, silent image\n2nd level (2 slots): blindness/deafness, invisibility</p>",
